# TypeScript Vendor Notes

This directory vendors the TypeScript compiler runtime used by vjsx for runtime
transpilation.

- Source: https://www.npmjs.com/package/typescript
- Version: 5.9.3
- License: Apache-2.0, retained in `LICENSE.txt`

Runtime files embedded into the vjsx binary:

- `lib/typescript.js`
- `lib/vjs_ts_bootstrap.js`
- `lib/vjs_ts_scan.js`
- `lib/vjs_ts_commonjs.js`
- `lib/vjs_ts_resolver.js`

`lib/typescript.js.gz` is a generated, deterministic gzip copy used only to keep
the embedded compiler asset small enough for the default V compile path.

To update, replace `package.json`, `LICENSE.txt`, and `lib/typescript.js` from
the npm TypeScript package, regenerate `lib/typescript.js.gz` with
`gzip -n -9 -c lib/typescript.js > lib/typescript.js.gz`, then keep the vjsx
helper files in `lib/` and run the TypeScript/runtime asset tests.
